  "body": "Enjoying all-day sunshine in the heart of Gulf Harbour, this beautifully presented townhouse offers the ideal blend of low-maintenance living and coastal convenience.\r\n\r\n* Ground Floor\r\nModern kitchen alongside a spacious open-plan dining and living area.\r\nExcellent indoor-outdoor flow to a broad entertaining deck featuring expansive views over Gulf Harbour and the Marina.\r\nA second separate living lounge and a guest toilet for added family flexibility.\r\n\r\n* Upper Level\r\nThree light-filled double bedrooms, including a master suite complete with a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite.\r\nA well-appointed main family bathroom.\r\n\r\n* Outdoors and Parking\r\nSunny, fully fenced courtyard providing a private, sheltered space for summer gatherings, children, and pets.\r\nDetached double garage with additional attic storage.\r\n\r\n268 Alec Craig Way is an easy stroll to local cafes, restaurants, Gulf Harbour Marina, and scenic coastal walking tracks. Close to top schools, including Gulf Harbour Primary School and Wentworth College and Primary, and an effortless Auckland CBD commute via the 50-minute Gulf Harbour ferry service.\r\n\r\nAn unbeatable option for first-home buyers, smart investors, or those seeking a premium lock-up-and-leave lifestyle.",
